let md=`# Current Serato/Open Play parity audit —17October2026\n\n**A full match is not established.** This is an independent audit of current source, all110feature groups/all522requirements, and scoped saved evidence. It awards no full-feature or full-requirement parity passes. This does **not** mean no features work. It means implemented independent behavior, labels and passing subsets do not prove every current Serato behavior.\n\nSnapshot: HEAD\`${git}\`; browser manifest\`${candidate.candidateCommit}\`; desktop\`${desktop.version}\` built from\`${desktop.implementationSourceCommit}\`. Current source has ${currentChanged.length} manifest mismatches and ${newPrototypeFiles.length} additional prototype files. Desktop0.1.5 has its own native persistence evidence; historical physical tests still belong to0.1.3. Generated${audit.generated_at}. The JSON companion contains all522requirement triggers/outcomes, all110acceptance criteria, source/report hashes, model routing and changed-file list.\n\nThis audit reads saved reports; it does not rerun tests or operate the reference. The parent freshly executed REA artifact inventory on installed4.0.10.213:1,742nodes/1,924occurrences, evidence\`${freshREA.REAInspectionEvidenceID}\`; executableSHA\`${freshREA.executableSHA256}\`. See ${link(E.rea)}. Artifact container inventory is not feature or runtime acceptance; fresh deep native trace timed out after20minutes with unresolved-byte/pcode and ObjcMessageAnalyzer diagnostics; no new function-level feature result. See ${link(E.reatrace)}. Existing Ghidra/REA evidence is static: CoreMIDI paths prove imports/call sites, not hardware maps or DSP algorithms. Fresh source facts below are labeled source observations; older runtime reports retain their original candidate/limits.\n\n## What is already proven, within its scope\n\n- **Current visual mismatch:** parent fresh screenshots/AX establish different mode/loop-control presentation and always-visible mixer in the inspected Vertical state. [Current UI comparison](../../docs/research/CURRENT_UI_COMPARISON_20261017.json) records screenshot hashes; private reference images remain ignored. This is a real mismatch, not a pixel comparison across differently sized windows.\n-  **User-confirmed physical subset:** Hercules browser-knob library navigation in Electron0.1.1. In0.1.3, selected Hercules master1/2+cue3/4: cue-only headphones play while powered speakers stay silent; master-only speakers play while headphones stay silent. Actual recordings independently decode quiet/nonzero master as expected. This is neither acoustic measurement nor full-map/hotplug/latency proof.\n- **Independent DSP functionality:** real59DJ processors (original4+55extended), four Channel processors, actual local SCNet inference, actual Signalsmith keylock, sampler/Pitch Play, selected-stem transport, Video processing/capture and various library paths have scoped evidence. Exact sound/quality/ranges/state equivalence remains open.\n- **Native persistence subset:** actual0.1.5 native chooser imported ownedWAV/MP3, quit removed old process/server, new PID restored both with no autoaudio, and both loaded/played into complete native-saved master captures. Expected330Hz left/550Hz right additionally measured over declared1–3s; whole streams decoded including natural-end silence. Browser13/13 storage and12/12 controlled tests remain separate layers. Native crash/eviction/real disk-full/allformats are not accepted. See ${link(E.nativepersist)}, ${link(E.nativewav)}, ${link(E.nativemp3)} and ${link(E.nativeaudio)}. The independent reviewer decoded original whole recordings; native UI/process observations remain the parent's separate evidence.\n- **Native keylock subset:** actual0.1.5 main UI sustained locked/unlocked/+2 pitch and keyboard scratch/release recordings were independently decoded. Separate real production-engine/WASM harness executed7/7 at44100Hz, with four armed online integrity spans; exported shifted stationary release independently passes its five pitch/gap criteria. Exact audible cursor, complete offline stereo reconstruction, compound/music/reference acceptance and earlier IAB capture failures remain open. See ${link(E.nativekeylockui)}, ${link(E.nativekeylockaudio)}, ${link(E.nativeengine)}, ${link(E.nativeenginereview)}.\n\n## Audit findings\n\n`;
